# Clean code

- Prefer clear names and small functions over comments.
- Comment only non-obvious business rules. Every comment is one line.
- No multi-line comment or JSDoc blocks.
- No drive-by refactors, dead code, unused imports, or commented-out blocks.
- Prefer typed errors and validation over silent coercion.
